<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Juda Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ocoyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga man Juda ocoyo bot luye ikare ma onongo gitye ka rwate ki lwak pwony goba mapatpat ma ngako dano. Gin jo ma kwero kit pa jo ma ngeyo Lubanga. I waragane en ocuku cwiny luye me cung matek i niye ma meggi mayam Lubanga dong omiyo ki gin ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga man pa Juda mito romaroma ki waraga me aryo ma Petero ocoyo, ma en lacoce ocoyo me cuku cwiny lukwane ni, “Myero gumede ameda kilweny pi niye ma Lubanga ceng omiyo tyen kicel keken bot gin jone”.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyutu ngat ma ocoyo buk man, dok ocoyo bot jo mene <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tyen lok me coyo waraga man <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lwongo me cuko cwiny <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lego gum <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Juda ma latic pa Yecu Kricito, ma omin Yakobo. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar 6:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Bot jo ma Lubanga olwongogi ma gibedo i mar pa Lubanga Won, ma Yecu Kricito tye ka gwokogi.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Kica, kuc ki mar myero omede ameda botwu.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lupwony ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Lurema, onongo atemo ki tekona ducu me coyo botwu waraga pi lok ikom lare ma wan ducu waribe iyeni, ci aneno ni myero aco waraga man me cuko cwinywu wek wulweny matek pi niye mayam dong kimiyo bot jo pa Lubanga tyen kicel keken madong otyeko lok ducu. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Pien jo mogo ma pe gilworo Lubanga ma gilibe aliba me donyo ikinwa dong gitye, gin jo ma kop mayam kingolo ikomgi dong kinyutu woko con i coc mayam kicoyo. Gin guloko pwony me kica ma Lubanga omiyowa botwa me bedo pi umu timgi me kwele, dok bene miyo gikwero Yecu Kricito ma en aye Rwotwa dok Laditwa acel keken.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Nia 12:51</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:29">Wel 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:30">30</ref> </char>
    </note> Kombedi wun jo mayam dong kimiyo wungeyo lok man con, dong amito dok apo wiwu ni, Rwot mayam olaro jo Icrael ki i lobo Ejipt, ento dok lacene en aye otyeko jo ma pe guye ikome en woko. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Lumalaika mayam pe gugwoko ka locgi ma kimiyo botgi, ento guweko kabedogi woko, en bene otweyogi ogwokogi kama col ki nyor ma rii nakanaka, nio wa i Nino madit me miyo botgi pwod ki ngolokope ikomgi. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Aca 19:1-24</ref> </char></note> Ikit yo acelu yam jo Codom ki Gomora ki taun madongo ma ingetgi, gudonyo i tim me kwele ki miti ma pe rwate ki kit ma obedo me anywali pa dano, ci Lubanga otyekogi woko kun miyo botgi pwod ki ngolo botgi kop me can me mac ma pe to, ci gin dong gubedo macalo lanen bot jo ducu ma miyo pwony me goba ni pwodgi bibedo macalo meno.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Nen kadi bed kitmeno, jonu bene ikit acelu, i lek ma gin leko, gubalo komgi woko, gukwero woko bene bedo ite twero pa Lubanga, kun dok bene giyeto wegi deyogu ayeta. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Niy 12:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:6">Nwo 34:6</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Jek 3:2</ref> </char></note> Ento ikare ma Mikael, lamalaika madit, yam olwenyo ki Catan kun pyem kwede pi yiko kom Moses, en yam pe ongwete pi ngolo kop mo me yet, ento oloko bote ni, “Rwot myero ojuki.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ento jo magi giyeto gin ma pe giniang iye, ento gin ma gingeyo malube ki kit ma kiketogi kwede, ma obedo calo lee ma pe ryek, aye tye ka tyekogi woko. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Aca 4:3-8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Wel 22:1-35</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Wel 16:1-35</ref> </char></note> Can malit ikomgi, gin jo ma miyo pwony ma ngako dano! Gin gilubu kit pa Kain ma oneko omine ikare ma Lubanga okwero gin ma en otyero pi nyeko, dok giketo tek mada i tam mogo ma pe atir pi mito lim kit macalo yam Balaam otimo me weko cwiny jo Icrael opyete pi timo bal wek egam lim me tyet, dok bene gito woko pi pyemo kit macalo yam Kora ojemo kwede ikom twero ma Lubanga omiyo ki latice Moses. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Gikelo lewic i karamawu me mar kun bene gicamo matek ma okato kare labongo lworo, dok bene giparo pi komgi keken. Gubedo calo pol ma pii peke iye ma yamo kolo; girom ki yadi ma nyiggi pe nen ikare me cekgi, ma gibedo calo yat ma kiputu lwitgi woko ma pe twero nyako nyiggi mo, gin yam dong guto kiryo. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Gical bene ki nam ma twage mager, ki tim me bwamigi kelo bwoyo me lewicgi ma bedo calo yugi ma core idye namgu; gin lakalatwe ma wire atata ma Lubanga otyeko yubu kakagi woko i kabedo macol licuc pi kare ma pe gik.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:18">Aca 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref> </char>
    </note> Magi gin aye gin mayam Enoka, ma obedo lakwar Adam me abiro, yam otito pire macalo lanebi ni, “Wunen, Rwot bibino ki lwak malaikane maleng mapol ata alip ki alip, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kangolo kop ikom jo ducu ma timgi racu, ki kamiyo kop wek oloo jo ducu ma pe gilworo Lubanga pi timgi ducu ma pe giyomo cwiny Lubanga, ki pi lok me gero ducu ma lubalo ma pe gilworo Lubanga guloko ikome.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Meno gin jo ma bedo ka ngur angura, ma gipyem apyema, kun gilubu mere mitigi me kom keken, doggi bene opong ki loko lok me wake keken, gidworo dano mo wek ginong gin ma cwinygi mito.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me ciko ki pwony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ento wun lurema ma amaro, myero wupo ikom lok mayam lukwena pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito gutito pire con. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 Pet 3:3</ref> </char></note> Gin yam gutito botwu ni, “Ikare me agiki lucac bibedo tye, ma gibilubu mitigi keken, ma pe gilworo Lubanga.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Jo ma kitmeno gin aye lukel apokapoka, gin jo ma miti me kom aye telogi, Cwiny pa Lubanga peke botgi. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ento wun luwota, wudong matek i niyewu maleng tutwali, kun wulego Lubanga pi tek pa Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Wugwoke kenwu i mar pa Lubanga, dok wukur kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ma telowa nio wa i kwo ma pe tum. <verse eid="JUD 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Wubed ki kica ikom jo mogo ma gitye ka cabe acaba, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />wular jo mogo ki ikom pwony ma ngako dano kit macalo olaro jami ki i mac kun wuceyogi woko aceya ki i mac. Wubed ki kica ikom jo mukene kun wulworo bene, dok wukwer bene kit yogi me bal woko.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me pak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Bot en Ngat matwero gwokowu miyo pe wupoto, dok matwero miyo wucung labongo roc mo inyim deyone ki yomcwiny, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />deyo, dit, loc ki twer ducu obed bot Lubanga en acel keken, ma Lalarwa, pi Yecu Kricito Rwotwa, cake nia con ki con, nio koni, ki kare ma pe gik. Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>